OPTION A(i): PANEL CANDIDATES, ARRAY WIRINGS AND THE FIXED-VOLTAGE STAGE (array_calc.py, stream a1solar, MESHSAT-1357).
PROTOTYPE DESIGN: nothing bought, built or measured. AI arithmetic on the makers' published figures; not a qualified review.

0. CONSTANTS
   cold cells -20 C; hot cells +70 C at 1000 W/m2; edge-of-cloud factor 1.25 (SunPower 524958 Rev F 3.0); rating factor 1.25
   stage window 200 W; energy model's performance ratio 0.9417 (MPPT assumed); LT8705A FBIN 1.184 / 1.205 / 1.226 V (8705af p.4)
   board E as generated: R8 102k over R9 7.50k holds the input at 17.29 / 17.59 / 17.90 V (min / typ / max)
   lead ESTIMATE: 5 m each way of 4 mm2 copper at 40 C = 0.0465 ohm loop
   coefficient bound where unpublished: Voc -0.35 %/K, Pmax -0.45 %/K, Isc +0.05 %/K (worst held mono c-Si values)

