2. THE WIRINGS THAT GIVE ABOUT 400 Wp
   Voc cold = Ns x Voc at -20 C cells; Voc x1.25 = the maker's clause on the STC figure; V rating = the larger.
   Isc hot = Np x Isc at +70 C and 1000 W/m2; Isc eoc = x1.25; I rating (fuse, connector) = x1.25 of Isc eoc.
   Backfeed = (Np - 1) x Isc eoc into one faulted string, against the module's series fuse rating.
